{"reviewId": "363182609_842nQrVhw", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "现在正处于康波萧条期（冬季），绝大多数人的心理活动都由低迷、保守、务实、焦虑、恐惧构成，也可以称之为时代的烙印。也印证了时代的一粒灰尘落在普通人身上都是一座不可撼动的大山，宿命的无力感难以对抗，当时代在清算时，个人的理性、努力、意志都显得微不足道。\n落幕与重生，坍塌与重建，迷雾与曙光，唯一在反抗过程中心不死，才能守得住种子生根发芽。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "康波的本质表现是价格的波动，而人生的财富积累根本上源于资产价格的投资或投机，人生财富靠康波，康波就是人生的财富规划", "range": "1237-1294", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "363182609_842nQrVhw", "userVid": 363182609, "topics": [], "createTime": 1760942750, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 363182609, "name": "       ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-rbxn9E6mTegMEgduo2tQe10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202411-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 204366970, "name": "dove", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/q0CXT6RDScOPE3v2hibLb7WMYrAZknkzSwmoaPCOtPRibrTClD1aLuibbgj5ibgRcxKvTJrtrnMlVicxgzyoZAqUUTVSS4mFURzUcl75ibb0rlAto/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 2000}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "也要确保不被物理消灭💪", "reviewId": "363182609_842nQrVhw", "commentId": "363182609_842nQrVhw_